26:["$","$L4b",null,{"faqs":[{"question":"What is web development, and how is it different from web design?","answer":"Web design is how a site looks and feels — layout, brand, and UX. Web development is how it's engineered — the code, speed, and functionality. A real website needs both. We design and build, end to end: design that converts and engineering that's fast and ranks."},{"question":"Custom website vs a template or website builder?","answer":"Builders like Wix and Squarespace are fast and cheap, but generic, slower, and limited — and you're renting a platform. A custom website is built around your business: faster, unique, SEO-ready, and fully yours to own and extend. For a serious business, custom pays for itself."},{"question":"How much does a custom website cost?","answer":"It depends on the pages, features, and whether it's a marketing site, ecommerce, or a web app. We work three ways: a fixed-scope custom website priced up front, a larger web app or ecommerce build, or a dedicated nearshore web team from $50 USD/hour. Affordable senior nearshore costs a fraction of a US agency — and you own everything."},{"question":"How long does it take to build a website?","answer":"A focused marketing site is typically a few weeks; ecommerce and web apps take longer depending on scope. We start with a discovery phase and give you a costed plan and timeline up front — no open-ended surprises."},{"question":"Do I own my website and code?","answer":"Yes — always. Your code, design, CMS, and site are yours, hosted on your accounts. No lock-in to a rented builder or our agency; you can run it, extend it, or take it anywhere."},{"question":"Are you a web design company near me (Texas / Monterrey)?","answer":"Yes — we're a bilingual web design and development company local to Texas and Monterrey, working across the US and Mexico in your time zone. You get a nearby, responsive partner with US-quality design and engineering at a fraction of a big-agency price."},{"question":"Will my website be fast and rank on Google?","answer":"That's the point. We build for Core Web Vitals (speed), with clean technical SEO, schema, and a structure search and AI engines can read — from day one. And our SEO team can take it further once it's live."},{"question":"What's included in your custom web development services?","answer":"Our custom web development services cover the whole build: UX and UI design, hand-coded front-end in React or Next.js (or WordPress), back-end and APIs, ecommerce, technical SEO with Core Web Vitals, and analytics setup. Hosting, SSL, and a 3-month warranty are included, and you own all the code. Every project is custom, not a template."},{"question":"Do you offer custom web application development?","answer":"Yes. Beyond marketing sites, we do custom web application development: interactive apps, client portals, dashboards, SaaS products, and progressive web apps (PWAs). We build the front-end, back-end, database, and APIs, then integrate with the tools you already use. You get a real product that you own, not a rented platform."},{"question":"What's the difference between a website and a custom web app?","answer":"A website presents information: pages, content, and maybe a store. A custom web app does work, so users log in, enter data, and use live functionality like dashboards, bookings, or portals. Custom web app development is software, so it costs more than a marketing site, and we scope and price it after a short discovery phase."}],"id":"faq","title":"What people ask before building a site.","fill":true}]
