site cost"},{"title":"Custom website vs template / website builder","slug":"custom-website-vs-template","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Custom website vs template: a template or website builder gets you live fast and cheap, while a custom website is built around your business so it converts, ranks, and scales. Here's how to choose — and what each really costs.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/redef-custom-vs-template-screens.webp","imageAlt":"Two screens showing a custom layout versus repeated templates, custom website vs template"},{"title":"How long does it take to build a website?","slug":"how-long-to-build-a-website","category":"Guide","excerpt":"How long to build a website? Most sites take 4 to 16 weeks depending on scope. Here's a realistic timeline by site type — marketing sites, ecommerce, and custom web apps — and what actually drives the schedule.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/redef-howlong-code-hourglass.webp","imageAlt":"Code on a monitor beside an hourglass, a metaphor for how long it takes to build a website"},{"title":"Web app vs website: what's the difference?","slug":"web-app-vs-website","category":"Guide","excerpt":"Web app vs website: a website shows you information, a web app lets you do something with it. Here's the real difference — interactivity, cost, build time, and which one your business actually needs.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/redef-webapp-vs-website.webp","imageAlt":"A smartphone app beside a website on a monitor, illustrating web app vs website"},{"title":"What is web development? (vs web design — and cost)","slug":"what-is-web-development","category":"Guide","excerpt":"What is web development? It's the engineering that builds and runs a website — the code behind what you see. Here's how it differs from web design, what a custom build costs, and how the two work together to ship a site that converts.","readMin":5,"date":"Jun 2026","image":"/blog/covers/redef-whatis-webdev-code.webp","imageAlt":"A web developer's hands on a keyboard with code on screen, illustrating what web development is"}],"className":"mt-8"}]]}]
