y, Gemini & Google AI Overviews — structured data, llms.txt, AI-crawler access, and more. Get a 0–100 score plus the fixes.","aiEyebrow":"Free tool · GEO / AEO","aiHeroTitle":"Is your business visible to AI search?","aiHeroLead":"Search is moving from blue links to AI answers. Check how citable your site is by ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini & Google AI Overviews — a 0–100 score and the exact fixes, instantly.","aiWhatWeCheck":"What we check","aiCheckStructuredData":"Structured data (Schema.org)","aiCheckFaqSchema":"FAQ / Q&A schema","aiCheckLlmsTxt":"llms.txt","aiCheckCrawlerAccess":"AI-crawler access (GPTBot, ClaudeBot, PerplexityBot, Google-Extended)","aiCheckHeadingStructure":"Heading structure","aiCheckTitleMeta":"Title & meta description","aiCheckCanonical":"Canonical URL","aiAuditDisclaimer":"This is a readiness audit (deterministic signals). For a live citation check across AI engines, that's part of our","aiAuditServiceLink":"GEO / AEO service","aiUrlAria":"Website URL","aiSubmitCheck":"Check AI visibility","aiSubmitChecking":"Checking…","gateEyebrow":"Analysis ready","gateTitle":"Unlock your full results","gateBody":"Tell us where to send it and we'll reveal the full report. A senior consultant may follow up with a plan — no spam.","gateNamePh":"Your name","gateNameAria":"Your name","gateEmailPh":"you@company.com","gateEmailAria":"Your email","gatePhonePh":"WhatsApp or phone (optional)","gatePhoneAria":"WhatsApp or phone (optional)","gateCompanyPh":"Company (optional)","gateCompanyAria":"Company (optional)","gatePromptName":"First — what should we call you?","gatePromptCompany":"Where do you work?","gatePromptContact":"Where do we send your results?","gateLabelName":"Name","gateLabelCompany":"Company","gateOptional":"Optional","gateContinue":"Continue","gateBack":"back","gateSubmit":"See results","gateSubmitting":"Loading…","gateNote":"We'll only use your details to send the report and, if you'd like, follow up.","gateNameRequired":"Please enter your name.","gateEmailInvalid":"Please enter a valid email.","gateErrorSubmit":"Something went wrong. Please try again.","gateErrorNetwork":"Network error. Please try again.","ctaPrimary":"Let's talk","aiCtaSecondary":"How we get you cited by AI","seoCtaSecondary":"How we rank you on Google","aiCtaStrongEyebrow":"Don't get comfortable","aiCtaStrongTitle":"You're ahead — for now.","aiCtaStrongBody":"AI visibility is a moving target. The sites AI recommends next quarter are the ones optimizing this week. Blink and the lead is gone — let's lock it in before someone else does.","aiCtaWeakEyebrow":"Warning · you're invisible to AI","aiCtaWeakTitle":"Right now, AI can't recommend you.","aiCtaWeakBody":"Every question people ask an AI is a customer you're not even in the running for — and your competitors already are. This is the bare minimum, and we fix it in under a week. Every day you wait, you keep losing them.","seoCtaStrongEyebrow":"Good — but not safe","seoCtaStrongTitle":"Solid scores. Easy to lose.","seoCtaStrongBody":"This is where most sites plateau — and where rankings quietly slip. The real advantage — rankings, AI citations, speed at scale — goes to whoever keeps pushing. Let's make sure that's you, not your competitor.","seoCtaWeakEyebrow":"Warning · this is costing you","seoCtaWeakTitle":"Slow site. Lost customers. Today.","seoCtaWeakBody":"Every extra second of load time and every missing basic is traffic — and revenue — walking out the door right now. This is the essential minimum, and it's fixable in under a week. Your competitors won't wait. You shouldn't either.","aiErrorGeneric":"Something went wrong.","aiErrorNetwork":"Network error — try again.","aiScoreOutOf":"/ 100 · AI visibility","aiScoreStrong":"Strong AI visibility","aiScoreGettingThere":"Getting there","aiScoreNeedsWork":"Needs work","aiScoreInvisible":"Largely invisible to AI","aiLeadSent":"✓ On its way — we'll send your full GEO action plan shortly.","aiLeadTitle":"Get the full GEO action plan","aiLeadBo